{"seq":1,"slug":"progress-reveal","title":"进度与揭示效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/patterns/progress-reveal","wordCount":1074,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"进度与揭示效果\">进度与揭示效果</h1><p>每个内容站点最先想做的两个滚动效果，几乎都是这两个：页面顶部那条随阅读推进铺满的进度条，和文章里图片、卡片滚进视口时优雅淡入上移的揭示动画。它们一个用滚动进度时间线、一个用可见性进度时间线，是 CSS API 章两类时间线最直接的落地，也是验证「我真的学会了」的第一道实操题。本篇给出两者可直接抄用的完整配方，并讲清各自的坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两个效果各自对应一类时间线，分野在于「关心什么」。阅读进度条关心「整页滚了多少」，进度是滚动容器的纯函数，用滚动进度时间线（<code>scroll-timeline</code>），且因进度条 <code>position: fixed</code> 与滚动容器无祖先关系，必须用命名时间线解耦。揭示动画关心「这个元素自己走到哪了」，进度是单个元素穿越视口的纯函数，用可见性进度时间线（<code>view()</code>），并用 <code>animation-range: entry</code> 把动画收进「进入阶段」播完。两者的共同硬约束是只动 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code>——进度条用 <code>scaleX</code> 而非 <code>width</code>，揭示用 <code>translateY</code> 而非 <code>top</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"顶部阅读进度条\">顶部阅读进度条</h2><p>进度条要表达的是「整页滚动了多少」，天生属于滚动进度时间线。难点不在动画本身，而在进度条通常 <code>position: fixed</code> 在顶部，它在 DOM 上不是滚动容器的子元素，匿名 <code>scroll()</code> 会绑错。正确做法是用命名时间线绑根滚动容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes grow-progress {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: scaleX(0);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: scaleX(1);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;:root {&#10;  scroll-timeline: --page block;&#10;}&#10;.reading-progress {&#10;  position: fixed;&#10;  inset-block-start: 0;&#10;  inline-size: 100%;&#10;  block-size: 4px;&#10;  transform-origin: left;&#10;  animation: grow-progress auto linear;&#10;  animation-timeline: --page;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> grow-progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  scroll-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: --page </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">block</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.reading-progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  inset-block-start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  inline-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  block-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform-origin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: grow-progress </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: --page;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用 <code>scaleX</code> 而非改 <code>width</code>，是因为 <code>transform</code> 能跑在合成线程、不触发布局，这是性能的硬约束，理由在 <a href=\"../practice/scroll-performance\">滚动动画性能</a> 详述。命名时间线 <code>--page</code> 与作用域规则在 <a href=\"../css-api/scroll-timeline\">scroll-timeline</a> 已讲透，这里直接复用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[&quot;:root 滚动容器&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;scroll-timeline: --page&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; PB[&quot;.reading-progress 引用 --page&quot;]&#10;    PB --&gt; SX[&quot;scaleX 0→1 合成线程&quot;]\">graph TD\n    R[\":root 滚动容器\"] --&gt; N[\"scroll-timeline: --page\"]\n    N --&gt; PB[\".reading-progress 引用 --page\"]\n    PB --&gt; SX[\"scaleX 0→1 合成线程\"]</pre><h2 id=\"揭示动画-进入即淡入\">揭示动画：进入即淡入</h2><p>揭示效果要的是「每个元素按自己进入视口的进度淡入」，这是可见性进度时间线的主场。核心是 <code>view()</code> 加 <code>animation-range: entry</code>，让动画恰好在元素进入阶段播完：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes reveal {&#10;  from {&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;    transform: translateY(2rem);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;    transform: translateY(0);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;.reveal-on-scroll {&#10;  animation: reveal auto linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view();&#10;  animation-range: entry 0% entry 60%;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> reveal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.reveal-on-scroll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: reveal </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entry 0% entry 60%</code> 让淡入在元素进入到 60% 行程时就完成，剩下的进入过程元素已完全显示，不会拖到「都快滚走了还在淡入」的尴尬。<code>both</code> 保证进入前隐藏、之后保持。<code>view-timeline</code> 与 <code>entry</code> 关键字的语义分别见 <a href=\"../css-api/view-timeline\">view-timeline</a> 和 <a href=\"../css-api/animation-range\">animation-range 区间</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种效果的对照\">两种效果的对照</h2><p>把两个效果摆一起，能看清「该用哪条时间线」的判断依据——是关心容器整体，还是关心单个元素。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>阅读进度条</th>\n<th>揭示动画</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间线类型</td>\n<td>滚动进度(scroll)</td>\n<td>可见性进度(view)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关心对象</td>\n<td>整页滚了多少</td>\n<td>单元素到哪了</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定方式</td>\n<td>命名时间线(fixed 解耦)</td>\n<td>匿名 <code>view()</code> 就近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型 range</td>\n<td>全程 0%-100%</td>\n<td><code>entry</code> 子区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键动画属性</td>\n<td><code>scaleX</code></td>\n<td><code>opacity</code>+<code>translateY</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"批量揭示与交错\">批量揭示与交错</h2><p>揭示动画的优雅之处是它天然「每元素独立」——给一组卡片同一段 CSS，它们各自按自己的进入进度淡入，无需任何 JS 遍历。想做「交错（stagger）」即卡片们依次而非同时淡入，纯 CSS 下可以靠每个元素进入视口的时间差天然错开；若要更精确的交错，可结合 <code>animation-range</code> 的偏移或给不同列设不同 inset。这种「零 JS 批量动画」是声明式相对命令式最爽的地方——过去要写一个 IntersectionObserver 回调挨个加 class，现在一段 CSS 搞定全部。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[&quot;一段 .reveal CSS&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;卡片1 按自身进入进度&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C2[&quot;卡片2 按自身进入进度&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C3[&quot;卡片3 按自身进入进度&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; O[&quot;天然交错,无需 JS 遍历&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; O&#10;    C3 --&gt; O\">flowchart TD\n    S[\"一段 .reveal CSS\"] --&gt; C1[\"卡片1 按自身进入进度\"]\n    S --&gt; C2[\"卡片2 按自身进入进度\"]\n    S --&gt; C3[\"卡片3 按自身进入进度\"]\n    C1 --&gt; O[\"天然交错,无需 JS 遍历\"]\n    C2 --&gt; O\n    C3 --&gt; O</pre><p>要注意揭示动画的无障碍问题：大幅位移对前庭敏感用户不友好，必须用 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 降级为纯透明度或直接显示，这是上线前的硬门槛，见 <a href=\"../practice/scroll-animation-a11y\">减少动效与可访问性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>进度条用滚动进度时间线 + 命名时间线(因 fixed 解耦)，用 <code>scaleX</code> 跑合成线程。</li>\n<li>揭示动画用可见性时间线 <code>view()</code> + <code>animation-range: entry</code>，<code>both</code> 保持端点，恰好在进入阶段播完。</li>\n<li>选时间线的判据：关心「整页滚了多少」用 scroll，关心「单元素到哪了」用 view。</li>\n<li>揭示天然每元素独立，一段 CSS 即可批量+交错，省掉 IntersectionObserver 回调；务必配 reduced-motion 降级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：进度条命名时间线见 <a href=\"../css-api/scroll-timeline\">scroll-timeline</a>；揭示的时间线与区间见 <a href=\"../css-api/view-timeline\">view-timeline</a>、<a href=\"../css-api/animation-range\">animation-range 区间</a>；性能与无障碍见 <a href=\"../practice/scroll-performance\">滚动动画性能</a>、<a href=\"../practice/scroll-animation-a11y\">减少动效与可访问性</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：滚动滥用对核心 Web 指标的影响见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/rendering-performance\">web-performance-vitals 的渲染性能</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.joshwcomeau.com/animation/scroll-driven-animations/\">Scroll-Driven Animations · Josh W. Comeau</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Scroll-driven_animations\">CSS scroll-driven animations · MDN</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"进度与揭示效果","id":"进度与揭示效果"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"顶部阅读进度条","id":"顶部阅读进度条"},{"level":2,"text":"揭示动画：进入即淡入","id":"揭示动画-进入即淡入"},{"level":2,"text":"两种效果的对照","id":"两种效果的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"批量揭示与交错","id":"批量揭示与交错"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"animation-range 区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/css-api/animation-range"},"next":{"title":"视差与钉住","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/patterns/parallax-pinning"}}